From cdc2b712ef6765a3d2ffb4b656c44964597b7926 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:45:02 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: share xPON rules and preserve failed
 replacements

Provisioning across several UNIs and priorities can exhaust the
256-entry software classifier with duplicate rules. Use the same cookie-
aware table on Airoha and EcoNet, preserve the old mapping until
replacement is possible, and compact fragmented cookie buckets on
exhaustion.

Provide read-only validation of a complete classifier set and
distinguish classifier capacity errors with occupancy and rule
diagnostics. Add KUnit coverage for sharing, bucket lifetime, full
tables, failed replacements, compaction and wildcard matches.
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/Kconfig                |  10 +
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/Makefile               |   3 +-
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c           | 253 ++++++++-------------
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.h           |  21 +-
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_xpon_service.c  | 137 +++++++++++
 .../net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_xpon_service_test.c | 189 +++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 455 insertions(+), 158 deletions(-)

